# `build.rs` regenerates src/pty/conpty/win_bindings.rs with windows-bindgen,
# which always writes LF. Pin this file to LF so a checkout with
# core.autocrlf=true does not leave CRLF on disk for build.rs to "modify" -
# `cargo publish` fails verification when a build script changes anything
# under src/ ("Source directory was modified by build.rs"), and it also makes
# the file show up as spuriously dirty in git status after every build.
src/pty/conpty/win_bindings.rs text eol=lf
